# Apricity libraries (data + files), wherever they are created
*.apricity/

# In-progress `apricity sources fetch` staging (archive download and extraction)
/samples/**/.extract/
/samples/**/.archive.part

# Audio never lives in git: fetched assets and libraries are synced (design/storage.md), not committed.
